  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Financial support of the Slovak Republic on the activities of EED in 2017 in a total amount of 30 000 Eur. EED is a flexible and effective tool for supporting the democracy in third countries.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Finan&#x10d;n&#xfd; pr&#xed;spevok SR na aktivity EED na rok 2017 vo v&#xfd;&#x161;ke 30 000 Eur. EED je pova&#x17e;ovan&#xfd; za flexibiln&#xfd; a efekt&#xed;vny n&#xe1;stroj na podporu demokracie v tret&#xed;ch rajin&#xe1;ch.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
